{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d52b7abd5c13a814","name":"The Revanchists","source":{"id":"source:reference-d52b7abd5c13a814","title":"The Revanchists","revision":22405,"timestamp":"2024-09-03T19:58:55Z","sha256":"68fc17a55991df0cb65e508cf013d1895d25e52a77eb0ea858c17483149dd493","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=22405","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Revanchists&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d52b7abd5c13a814","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After a series of military failures, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," once again turns to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," for aid. Having been hit the hardest by the casualties of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," refuses, at first, to join the military effort. However, among the Jedi are a few who cannot stand by while the Mandalorian invasion batters at the Republic's defenses, including a powerful Jedi called ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"}," leads other like-minded Jedi \"Revanchists\" into battle once more, despite the Order's directive that they should not be involved. After victories against ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorians","referenceId":"reference:b7f4f8a44de3a6c8"},", even more Jedi flock to Revan's call. Over time, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," cedes control of many of its military assets to the Jedi, and The Mandalorian Wars begin in full.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As Jedi- such as their loyal friend ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malak"},"- flock to Revan's flag, the Council warns that their aggressions could transform them into the very conquerors they fought. The moral lines are already blurring as Revan adopts Mandalorian Crusader rhetoric, calling their own cause a \"Jedi Crusade.\" ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," seems with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"},", however, as their Jedi beat the enemy back. Soon, the Republic military cedes control to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"},", without regret. After three long years, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"}," vanquishes The Mandalorians' chieftain in single combat and shatters their navy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As battles rage across the galaxy, Mandalorians win victories against the Republic and the Republic reclaims territories lost to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorians","referenceId":"reference:b7f4f8a44de3a6c8"},". Quickly, Jedi such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"}," and their apprentice, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malak"},", become war heroes. After years of violent conflict, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," finally manages to repel ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorians","referenceId":"reference:b7f4f8a44de3a6c8"}," with a devastating victory at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"},". There, the Mandalorian forces are nearly wiped out. The surviving Mandalorians go into exile, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," are heralded as saviors of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"},". Surprisingly, though, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malak"}," gather the remnants of their fleets and flee into ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"},". For a short few months, peace reigns in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," once more, but questions surround the departure of The Revanchists.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Revanchist Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Crusader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Crusader","referenceId":"reference:799b7129f0708867"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 11\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Crusader Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Crusader_Squad","referenceId":"reference:e0e7f427c18ae3b3"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 13\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Exile"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Exile","referenceId":"reference:14a6bc1c3e545c58"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan_(CL_16)","referenceId":"reference:8e0242aa6839f4fd"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 16\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":[